cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this simulator in research or a report, please cite it as below."
title: "drone-swarm-relay-sim: a drone-swarm relay-mesh simulator with real radio presets"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Dhruv
    alias: dalailalama
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/dalailalama/drone-swarm-relay-sim"
url: "https://dalailalama.github.io/drone-swarm-relay-sim/"
abstract: >-
  Zero-dependency browser simulator of a drone swarm that holds a relay mesh
  between a ground station and a far objective, with real radio presets, a
  calibrated path-loss model, jamming and GPS denial, and a Python bridge that
  flies the same plan on ArduPilot SITL.
keywords:
  - drone swarm
  - relay mesh
  - radio propagation
  - simulation
  - ArduPilot SITL
